{"data":[{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110238848055939072","3_2110238861880446976","3_2110238874375200768","3_2110238884143751169"]},"author_id":"1313326464461283328","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:18:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110238892712759714"],"id":"2110238892712759714","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":398,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":5},"text":"Gourango Kuilya is an artist at par when it comes to large scale, spectacular installations. No heavy thematic jargons but peak marvellous visuals, mostly using recycled materials! His dragon themed pandal at Tridhara is already chartbuster. Check out Haridevpur 41 Pally too! PC https://t.co/XxJOUmc4VT","url":"https://x.com/horek_rokom/status/2110238892712759714"},{"author_id":"1496378617018068992","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:16:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110238390117691762"],"id":"2110238390117691762","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":23,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@Amit4Films North Kol-Chorebagan,then metro,Sovabazar,Ahiritola,Kumartuli,Bagbazar,JGP stretch and then walk towards Hatibagan,Hatibagan Sarbojanin,Nalin Sarkar and then walk 15 mins to Kashi bose lane may be can continue to ChaltaBagan through Manicktala and then Santosh Mitra Square","url":"https://x.com/11Upla/status/2110238390117691762"},{"author_id":"1496378617018068992","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:14:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110237903758688353"],"id":"2110237903758688353","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":22,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@Amit4Films Singhee Park,Hindustan Club,H.Park, go for Jodhpur Park(only if you have time)then to Deshapriya Park,Tridhara,B.Cultural,end it at RB Av Badamtala,66 Pally,and then can walk to Chetla or can take bus to Mudiali,Shibmandir and then Suruchi circuit(might be)","url":"https://x.com/11Upla/status/2110237903758688353"},{"author_id":"1496378617018068992","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:12:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110237250391064938"],"id":"2110237250391064938","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":14,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@Amit4Films Behala cluster-41 Pally,Ajeya Sanghati from Tollygungeauto,then take s31 to Chowrasta and do Barisha then after bus to Behala 14 no. do Natun Dal,and others there then will get an auto to Buroshibtala do that and end it and Suruchi\n\nRB Av-Rajdanga Naba Uday,Bosepukur ones,Ekdalia","url":"https://x.com/11Upla/status/2110237250391064938"},{"author_id":"1496378617018068992","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:04:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110235342951546903"],"id":"2110235342951546903","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":21,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@EducatedMoron also for most guys accessing metro always do DumDum cluster with Tala Prattoy at start because you need to take auto from Belgachia\n\nalso for North Kolkata cluster from Nalin Sarkar always go to Kashi Bose Lane\n\nKasba cluster should start from Rajdanga Naba Uday","url":"https://x.com/11Upla/status/2110235342951546903"},{"author_id":"1496378617018068992","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:02:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110234695871136255"],"id":"2110234695871136255","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":25,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@EducatedMoron mani corrections to this\nBehala Cluster should ideally start with Haridevpur 41 Pally and Ajeya Sanghati take S31 bus or auto to Chowrasta for Barisha and then continue the rest and if you really going to Buroshibtala should ideally end it at Suruchi considering its 10 minutes","url":"https://x.com/11Upla/status/2110234695871136255"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2109874368755183616"],"media_source_tweet_id":["2109874398656168211"]},"author_id":"1153194267138908160","created_at":"2026-10-13T18:11:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110070825269522481"],"id":"2110070825269522481","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":236,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"𝐇𝐚𝐫𝐢𝐝𝐞𝐯𝐩𝐮𝐫 41 Pally Club is one of South Kolkata’s most popular Durga Puja pandals. It is famous for its big, creative themes and attracts huge crowd. The 2026 theme reportedly explored “the different stages of life.\" https://t.co/FuqCWlUgFJ","url":"https://x.com/MonojitSinha11/status/2110070825269522481"},{"author_id":"1207325658554126336","created_at":"2026-10-13T10:36:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109956446301372534"],"id":"2109956446301372534","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":107,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@EducatedMoron No Kashi Bose Lane in North Kolkata Heritage route?! \nIt is very near to hathibagan sarbojanin and does exceedingly well every year.","url":"https://x.com/PiyushA31693504/status/2109956446301372534"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-10-13T09:40:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109942245214335171"],"id":"2109942245214335171","note_tweet":{"text":"Famous Kolkata Durga Puja pandals & nearest metro:\n\nKumartuli Park - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nBagbazar Sarbojanin - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nSovabazar Rajbari - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nAhiritola Sarbojanin - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nCollege Square - Central\nSantosh Mitra Square - Central\nEkdalia Evergreen - Kalighat\nDeshapriya Park - Kalighat\nSuruchi Sangha - Rabindra Sarobar\nSreebhumi Sporting Club - Belgachia\nDumdum Park - Belgachia/Dum Dum\n\nMetro is ideal for hopping; check live maps for crowds."},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":20,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@IndianGeostrat Famous Kolkata Durga Puja pandals &amp; nearest metro:\n\nKumartuli Park - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nBagbazar Sarbojanin - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nSovabazar Rajbari - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nAhiritola Sarbojanin - Shobhabazar Sutanuti\nCollege Square - Central\nSantosh Mitra Square - Central","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2109942245214335171"},{"author_id":"1935258772563443718","created_at":"2026-10-13T08:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109924604244287673"],"id":"2109924604244287673","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Hailing the legacy of pioneering children's author, poet, and illustrator Jogindranath Sarkar, Hatibagan Nabinpally presents ‘Hasikhushi Pujo’ as its definitive theme for its 93rd #DurgaPuja celebration. https://t.co/aW1ioWe63P","url":"https://x.com/smanandm/status/2109924604244287673"},{"author_id":"1294659577053552643","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:50:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109914769834779125"],"id":"2109914769834779125","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":31,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@ebfchub @Amit4Films North only for old school? Ahiritola, Kashi bose lane, Chorebagan, Tala Prottoy, Dumdum Park pujo's, Kumartuli etc they all are theme based pujo. Also you would find old school sabeki in South as well. So I would say North and South have both equally.","url":"https://x.com/iam_pheonix0/status/2109914769834779125"},{"author_id":"3868003454","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:43:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109912846398271869"],"id":"2109912846398271869","note_tweet":{"text":"So there are some 3000 pandals in the city. Covering all of them won't be possible or practical. If you want to do just the big and famous one, even that would be some 200 pandals and on Ashtami/Navami visiting just one of them can eat up 5-6 hours. \n\nSo this needs planning. Divide the city geograpically. Fix your priorities. Maximize the usage of day hours when rush is relatively lesser. \n\nHere are few routes. \n\nFirst and foremost my top 2 routes for those visiting Kolkata just for experiencing Pujo. \n\n1. Old/North Kolkata Heritage Route: These are the OG pujos.\n\nBagbazar Sarbojanin → Ahiritola Sarbojanin → Kumartuli Park → Sovabazar Rajbari → Hatibagan Sarbojanin → Nalin Sarkar Street → Tala Prattoy.\n\n2. Kasba to Jodhpur Park - My go-to stretch. This is one of the longest stretch you can cover in one day covering 15+ famous ones if you are ready to do 50000 steps in a day. \n\nStart at Bosepukur Sitala Mandir → Bosepukur Talbagan → Ekdalia Evergreen → Singhi Park  → Deshapriya Park → Tridhara Sammilani → Hindustan Park → Maddox Square →Mudiali → Jodhpur Park\n\nThen there are routes to cover depending upon where you staying:\n\nSalt Lake Cluster: These have relatively lesser rush and can be easily covered within a few hours (unless you get stuck in FD block one which is largest in scale)\nFD Block → AK Block → BJ Block → BD Block (plus you visit any additional blocks on the route)\n\nBehala Cluster: Would recommend to visit these during night. Behala Club → Behala Buroshibtala Janakalyan Sangha → Behala Natun Dal → Barisha Club → Barisha Sarbojanin\n\nVIP Road Cluster: Telengabagan → Sreebhumi Sporting Club → Lake Town Association → Dum Dum Park Tarun Sangha → Bharat Chakra → Dum Dum Park Youth Association \n\nAlipore Cluster: Alipore Sarbojanin → Chetla Agrani → Badamtala Ashar Sangha → 66 Pally → Suruchi Sangha\n\nGaria Cluster: Naktala Udayan Sangha → Naktala Pally Unnayan Samity → Garia Naba Durga → Pancha Durga → Patuli Sarbojanin \n\nIf you are not from Kolkata, I would suggest avoid the big Pujas of Central Kolkata (Md. Ali Park → Santosh Mitra Square → College Square). They get insane crowd from people flocking Kolkata from nearby districts for a day due to nearness to Sealdah and Howrah stations. They are very popular but you need adventurous spirit to tackle them."},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":63,"impression_count":4295,"like_count":108,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":11},"text":"So there are some 3000 pandals in the city. Covering all of them won't be possible or practical. If you want to do just the big and famous one, even that would be some 200 pandals and on Ashtami/Navami visiting just one of them can eat up 5-6 hours. \n\nSo this needs planning. https://t.co/KYHxFmIMLJ","url":"https://x.com/EducatedMoron/status/2109912846398271869"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2109881033776910336","13_2109881148281421824"]},"author_id":"1313326464461283328","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:37:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109881179801624722"],"id":"2109881179801624722","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":2646,"like_count":65,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":6},"text":"Anirban Das is among my fav theme artists. For Durgapuja 2026, he has made 5 pandals. My favourite ones are Naktala Udayan Sangha, based on theme Panjika, with a brilliant ambience, pandal &amp; linocut idol, and Alipore Sarbojonin, based on a gond folk-art retelling of Ramayan. VC https://t.co/DOKKVNV9a2","url":"https://x.com/horek_rokom/status/2109881179801624722"},{"author_id":"2087428590891933696","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:36:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109880825143824523"],"id":"2109880825143824523","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Kumartuli Park Durga Puja 2026 | শোভাবাজার মেট্রো থেকে কীভাবে যাবেন? Wal... https://t.co/OQ8RzAcnMx via @YouTube","url":"https://x.com/sharenews4u/status/2109880825143824523"},{"author_id":"2087428590891933696","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:35:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109880784366772435"],"id":"2109880784366772435","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Kumartuli Sarbojanin Durga Puja 2026 | শোভাবাজার মেট্রো থেকে কীভাবে যাবে... https://t.co/m7bs8TfEhO via @YouTube","url":"https://x.com/sharenews4u/status/2109880784366772435"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2109874368755183616"]},"author_id":"3007649773","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:10:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109874398656168211"],"id":"2109874398656168211","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":27,"impression_count":4001,"like_count":545,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":79},"text":"Haridevpur 41 Pally, South Kolkata \n\nFirst exclusive look 😯 \n\nBrilliant idol made 🙏 https://t.co/t9y6pXt0Tm","url":"https://x.com/biharigurl/status/2109874398656168211"},{"author_id":"1956172021399695360","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:55:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109840365327204380"],"id":"2109840365327204380","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Kumartuli Park Durga Puja 2026 | শোভাবাজার মেট্রো থেকে কীভাবে যাবেন? Wal... https://t.co/HpniN18PL7 via @YouTube","url":"https://x.com/Aditya228377257/status/2109840365327204380"},{"author_id":"1956172021399695360","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:55:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109840345915867593"],"id":"2109840345915867593","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Kumartuli Sarbojanin Durga Puja 2026 | শোভাবাজার মেট্রো থেকে কীভাবে যাবে... https://t.co/sRsNbW5f4g via @YouTube","url":"https://x.com/Aditya228377257/status/2109840345915867593"},{"author_id":"1345054994","created_at":"2026-10-12T17:55:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109704598764347478"],"id":"2109704598764347478","note_tweet":{"text":"you know wh there is no durga pujo vibes as highlighted by those leftist - choti chata TMC lads. \n\nFOR Nearly 5 decades we have been ruled by the group which were purely anti sanatani . the party that ruled Bengal for 34 years a chap from that Bikas Ranjan is saying that what does it take to do the durga pujo some ingredients why block red road\n\nthen for 15 years we had a party which made durga pujo all about itself. hoardes of alcohol companies flocking for advertisement in Singhi Park, Hindustan club and other places and playing AZAN and others \n\nthe people of bengal lived in fear for 355 days would pour all their heart at the enjoyment of these 10 days \n\nBut now there is no bhoy"},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":40,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"you know wh there is no durga pujo vibes as highlighted by those leftist - choti chata TMC lads. \n\nFOR Nearly 5 decades we have been ruled by the group which were purely anti sanatani . the party that ruled Bengal for 34 years a chap from that Bikas Ranjan is saying that what","url":"https://x.com/arcdsr/status/2109704598764347478"},{"author_id":"1340509422582333442","created_at":"2026-10-12T16:52:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109688716445008092"],"id":"2109688716445008092","note_tweet":{"text":"I am extremely happy and proud of the emphatic victory of the Nationalist Candidates backed by the Bharatiya Janata Party in today’s elections for the key Office-bearer posts of the West Bengal Bar Council.\nThe BJP backed panel have secured a decisive 18–8 mandate, thoroughly defeating the candidates put up by the Mamata Trinamool Congress and their allies CPM & Congress. \nShri Samir Pal was elected for the President's post while Shri Ajoy Choubey has been elected Vice President, while Shri Arun Sarkar has also emerged victorious.\n\nThis is a clear and resounding endorsement by the educated elite of West Bengal, the legal fraternity, who couldn't be swayed by the political theatrics of the Opposition. They have firmly put their weight behind Candidates who stand for Nationalist ideals, Constitutional values, and the Rule of Law.\n\nThis victory is a strong endorsement of the progressive work being done by the State Government under the double-engine leadership of Hon’ble Prime Minister Shri Narendra Modi Ji. \nI congratulate all the victorious Candidates and express my deep gratitude to those who have reposed their confidence in us. After the Puja celebrations, we will meet with the newly elected Bar Council Office-bearers and work on long-pending infrastructure and other issues faced by the Legal fraternity in West Bengal."},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":28,"impression_count":182035,"like_count":4306,"quote_count":8,"reply_count":204,"retweet_count":539},"text":"I am extremely happy and proud of the emphatic victory of the Nationalist Candidates backed by the Bharatiya Janata Party in today’s elections for the key Office-bearer posts of the West Bengal Bar Council.\nThe BJP backed panel have secured a decisive 18–8 mandate, thoroughly","url":"https://x.com/SuvenduWB/status/2109688716445008092"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109674705883922432"]},"author_id":"3051747481","created_at":"2026-10-12T15:57:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109674708803146115"],"id":"2109674708803146115","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Kumartuli Park Durga Puja 2026 | শোভাবাজার মেট্রো থেকে কীভাবে যাবেন? Walking Route https://t.co/RbP0URdT8p https://t.co/eESBtwl5oW","url":"https://x.com/responsivelp/status/2109674708803146115"},{"author_id":"3051747481","created_at":"2026-10-12T15:53:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109673750178521434"],"id":"2109673750178521434","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Kumartuli Park Durga Puja 2026 | শোভাবাজার মেট্রো থেকে কীভাবে যাবেন? Walking Route - YouTube https://t.co/9Z9rdqxX9y","url":"https://x.com/responsivelp/status/2109673750178521434"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109622146410668032","3_2109622178727780353","3_21096222922549944